{
  "name": "** Qualification automatique des leads par email",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Email Trigger (IMAP)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        200,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mailbox": "INBOX",
        "options": {
          "customEmailConfig": "[\"UNSEEN\"]",
          "downloadAttachments": false
        },
        "format": "simple",
        "postProcessAction": "read"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "imap": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_IMAP_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "IMAP account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Classifier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0,
          "maxTokens": 200
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "Vous êtes un classificateur qui range un email entrant dans exactement une des catégories suivantes : lead_chaud, lead_tiede, spam. Répondez uniquement en renvoyant un JSON avec la clef \"category\" et la valeur correspondante (lead_chaud, lead_tiede ou spam). Critères : lead_chaud = prospect manifeste un besoin urgent, budget évoqué ou demande de RDV; lead_tiede = intérêt exprimé mais pas d'urgence; spam = hors sujet, publicitaire ou non pertinent."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "=Classify the following email body and return only JSON {\"category\":\"...\"} : {{$json[\"textPlain\"] || $json[\"text\"] || $json[\"textHtml\"] || ''}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Parse Category",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        500,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of items) {\n  let category = 'spam';\n  const raw = item.json.message?.content || item.json.choices?.[0]?.message?.content || item.json.text || '';\n  try {\n    const match = String(raw).match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\n    if (match) {\n      const parsed = JSON.parse(match[0]);\n      if (parsed.category) category = parsed.category;\n    }\n  } catch (e) {\n    const lower = String(raw).toLowerCase();\n    if (lower.includes('lead_chaud')) category = 'lead_chaud';\n    else if (lower.includes('lead_tiede')) category = 'lead_tiede';\n  }\n  out.push({ json: { ...item.json, category } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "IF - is Hot?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        650,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "hot-condition",
              "leftValue": "={{$json[\"category\"]}}",
              "rightValue": "lead_chaud",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "IF - is Warm?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        650,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "warm-condition",
              "leftValue": "={{$json[\"category\"]}}",
              "rightValue": "lead_tiede",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "OpenAI Extract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        850,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0,
          "maxTokens": 400
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "Vous extrairez du corps de l'email les éléments suivants et renverrez un JSON valide : name (nom du contact, si identifiable sinon vide), company (nom de l'entreprise), need (besoin principal résumé en une phrase), urgency (faible/modérée/élevée). Répondez uniquement avec un objet JSON contenant ces 4 clefs."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "=Voici l'email : {{$json[\"textPlain\"] || $json[\"text\"] || $json[\"textHtml\"] || ''}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Parse Extract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        950,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of items) {\n  const raw = item.json.message?.content || item.json.choices?.[0]?.message?.content || item.json.text || '';\n  let data = { name: '', company: '', need: '', urgency: '' };\n  try {\n    const match = String(raw).match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\n    if (match) {\n      const parsed = JSON.parse(match[0]);\n      data = {\n        name: parsed.name || '',\n        company: parsed.company || '',\n        need: parsed.need || '',\n        urgency: parsed.urgency || ''\n      };\n    }\n  } catch (e) {}\n  out.push({ json: { ...item.json, ...data } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Google Sheets CRM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [
        1100,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "CRM",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "date": "={{ (new Date()).toLocaleString() }}",
            "category": "={{ $json[\"category\"] }}",
            "name": "={{ $json[\"name\"] }}",
            "company": "={{ $json[\"company\"] }}",
            "need": "={{ $json[\"need\"] }}",
            "urgency": "={{ $json[\"urgency\"] }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEETS_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "IF - is Hot after Extract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1250,
        150
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "hot-after-extract",
              "leftValue": "={{$json[\"category\"]}}",
              "rightValue": "lead_chaud",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Gmail Notify Commercial",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1450,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "REPLACE_WITH_COMMERCIAL_EMAIL@example.com",
        "subject": "=Nouveau lead chaud : {{$json[\"name\"] || 'Contact inconnu'}}",
        "message": "=Résumé du lead :\nNom : {{$json[\"name\"] || ''}}\nEntreprise : {{$json[\"company\"] || ''}}\nBesoin : {{$json[\"need\"] || ''}}\nUrgence perçue : {{$json[\"urgency\"] || ''}}\nCatégorie : {{$json[\"category\"]}}\nDate : {{$now}}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Gmail AutoReply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1450,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "={{ $json[\"from\"] || $json[\"sender\"] || $json[\"headers\"]?.from || '' }}",
        "subject": "Merci pour votre contact",
        "message": "Bonjour,\n\nMerci pour votre message. Nous l'avons bien reçu et reviendrons vers vous rapidement.\n\nCordialement,\nL'équipe commerciale\n\n(Automatique)",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Gmail Label Move",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
